      "captured_text": "I NEED A WEB DEVELOPER TO UPDATE OUR GOOGLE ANALYTICS CODE\n\n- or -\n\nPost a project like this\nEnds in 3110 days\nFixed Price\n£200(approx. $266)\n * Posted: 9 years ago\n * Proposals: 7\n * Remote\n * #1950167\n * OPPORTUNITY\n * PRE-FUNDED\n * Awarded\n\nExperience Level: Expert\n\nWe need a developer to assist in removing two erroneous Google Analytics tags that have been added incorrectly to the body section on our site, which is causing a data quality issue. We will need the tags removing and then Google Tag Manager adding to all pages.\n\nThere is some additional google code relating to the purchase on the payment confirmation page, which needs to be replaced with a data layer so it is compatible with Google Tag Manager\n \nThis should be completed without inhibiting the site’s usability and also in sync with publishing and testing the new Google Tag Manager container from our side.\n \nThe developer should also be able to conduct the work via Teamviewer remote control software.\n\nThis is a custom platform rather than something like Magento",
